### PawPrint API – request mẫu (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client)
### Dữ liệu mẫu: chạy `npm run db:seed` – mật khẩu chung: Pawprint@123
###   admin@pawprint.dev (ADMIN) · mod@pawprint.dev (ADMIN)
###   minh@pawprint.dev (Cloud+, Mochi + Bơ) · lan@pawprint.dev (FREE, Miu)
###   locked@pawprint.dev (LOCKED) · newbie@pawprint.dev (chưa có pet)
@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@token = paste-access-token
@adminToken = paste-admin-access-token
# Pet mẫu: Mochi (của minh). Bơ = ...c2, Miu (của lan) = ...c3
@petId = 5eed0000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000c1

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Đăng ký
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "owner@pawprint.app", "password": "Paw12345", "displayName": "Minh", "timeZone": "Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh" }

### Đăng nhập (user mẫu)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "minh@pawprint.dev", "password": "Pawprint@123" }

### Đăng nhập ADMIN
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@pawprint.dev", "password": "Pawprint@123" }

### Đăng nhập tài khoản bị khoá -> 403
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "locked@pawprint.dev", "password": "Pawprint@123" }

### Refresh token (rotation)
POST {{base}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "paste-refresh-token" }

### Quên mật khẩu
POST {{base}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "owner@pawprint.app" }

### Hồ sơ của tôi
GET {{base}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Chọn pet hiện hành
PATCH {{base}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPetId": "{{petId}}" }

### Tạo pet
POST {{base}}/pets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mochi", "species": "CAT", "breed": "British Shorthair", "sex": "FEMALE",
  "birthDate": "2024-03-01", "adoptedAt": "2024-05-10", "weightKg": 3.2 }

### Danh sách pet
GET {{base}}/pets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sửa pet (optimistic locking với version)
PATCH {{base}}/pets/{{petId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "note": "Thích ngủ trên bàn phím", "version": 1 }

### Together Days
GET {{base}}/pets/{{petId}}/together-days
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Xoá pet (bắt buộc confirm)
DELETE {{base}}/pets/{{petId}}?confirm=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---- Upload ảnh moment: B1 xin chữ ký
POST {{base}}/media/upload-url
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "purpose": "MOMENT" }

### B2: client upload multipart lên `uploadUrl` (Cloudinary) với file + api_key + signature + params
### B3: xác nhận
POST {{base}}/media/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "publicId": "pawprint/u_<userId>/moments/<uuid>" }

### B4: tạo moment
POST {{base}}/pets/{{petId}}/moments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "caption": "Ngày đầu về nhà 🏡", "occurredAt": "2024-05-10T09:00:00+07:00", "mediaIds": ["paste-media-id"] }

### Danh sách moments (cursor)
GET {{base}}/pets/{{petId}}/moments?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ghi cân nặng
POST {{base}}/pets/{{petId}}/care-records
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "WEIGHT", "valueDecimal": 3.45 }

### Ghi khám thú y
POST {{base}}/pets/{{petId}}/care-records
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "VET_VISIT", "title": "Tiêm phòng dại", "note": "Hẹn tái khám sau 1 năm" }

### Lịch sử chăm sóc (lọc)
GET {{base}}/pets/{{petId}}/care-records?type=WEIGHT&from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Biến động cân nặng
GET {{base}}/pets/{{petId}}/weights
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Timeline 1 pet
GET {{base}}/pets/{{petId}}/timeline?limit=20&kinds=MOMENT,MILESTONE,CARE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Timeline tổng hợp nhiều pet
GET {{base}}/timeline?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Thông báo
GET {{base}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Gói & quota
GET {{base}}/subscriptions/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### =============================== ADMIN (cần token của admin@pawprint.dev)
### Số liệu tổng quan
GET {{base}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Danh sách người dùng (lọc/tìm kiếm)
GET {{base}}/admin/users?limit=20&search=pawprint.dev
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Chi tiết người dùng (minh)
GET {{base}}/admin/users/5eed0000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000b1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Khoá tài khoản lan (thu hồi mọi phiên đăng nhập)
PATCH {{base}}/admin/users/5eed0000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000b2
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "LOCKED" }

### Mở khoá tài khoản locked
PATCH {{base}}/admin/users/5eed0000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000b3
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "ACTIVE" }

### Audit log
GET {{base}}/admin/audit-logs?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### User thường gọi API admin -> 403
GET {{base}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
